request.description:
Approve or reject a pending manual chain.

Get the chain_id from pending_chains[] in a /run or /run-file response.

Body:
  { chain_id: string, approved: boolean }

Response (approved):
  { success: true, approved: true, agent, output, chains, pending_chains, duration_ms }

Response (rejected):
  { success: true, approved: false, message: "Chain rejected" }

Note: chain_id is one-time use — consumed on first call (approved or rejected).
